/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# Exception: the committed DEBUG keystore (app/debug.keystore) is the
# standard Android debug identity (CN=Android Debug, passwords "android")
# — a debug keystore is not a secret. It exists so every CI build signs
# with the SAME key and APKs install over the top of each other; without
# it each Codemagic machine generates its own fresh debug key and every
# build refuses to update the previous one. Release keystores stay
# ignored — never commit one.
!app/debug.keystore
